---
description: 護眼學堂 education-site rules for Cursor
globs: src/**,public/**
alwaysApply: true
---

This is a Hong Kong public ophthalmology **education** site (eyesinfo.org), not a clinic shopfront.

- Traditional Chinese is the source language. Keep EN / JA / SC in sync when you change copy.
- No clinic address, phone, fees, booking, WhatsApp, or hyperlinks to a practice website.
- No drug, drop, IOL, or device brand names. Use classes / INN only.
- No testimonials, before/after photos, success rates, 根治, 保證, or canvassing.
- Simulators (Amsler, IOL, tunnel, floaters, halo) are illustrations, not tests. Keep the per-tool caveat.
- Emergency copy: 立即急症室 vs 應盡快（最好當日）散瞳眼底. Do not write 打999 except where the strabismus A&E heading already says 無法自行前往請打 999.
- Bump `CONTENT_VERSION` in `src/lib/site.ts` when publishing education changes.
- Lattice QR lives at `/qr` only. Do not list it on the home or patient tools list.
